Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.23 - compact app grid, tile effects, readable menus, stable panel
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Settings and Eduka-Panel.
 Eduka-Panel on any screen edge, a redesigned Eduka-Settings, optional
 effects for Eduka-Desktop on capable computers, digital/analog/LED clock
 with a day-and-night globe, per-application volume in the Action Center,
 Eduka-Panel as the only notification service, visible window buttons and
